{"title":"2025 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2025 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 1\">2025 AMC 10A #1</a> and <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2025 AMC 12A #1</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2_(Simplest_Version)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2 (Simplest Version)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Solution_5\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 5</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Solution_6\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 6</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Solution_7_(Calculus_Overkill)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 7 (Calculus Overkill)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_FormulaFocus_(Logical,_Good_Editing,_~1:00)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by FormulaFocus (Logical, Good Editing, ~1:00)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_baoziba\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by baoziba</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Daily_Dose_of_Math\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">11</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_DDM\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">12</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by DDM</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-13\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(Fast_and_Easy)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">13</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (Fast and Easy)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-14\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Power_Solve\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">14</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Power Solve</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-15\"><a href=\"#Chinese_Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">15</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Chinese Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-16\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution(Quick_and_Simple)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">16</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution(Quick and Simple)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-17\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(Intuitive,_Quick_Explanation!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">17</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (Intuitive, Quick Explanation!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-18\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_SpreadTheMathLove\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">18</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by SpreadTheMathLove</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-19\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">19</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-20\"><a href=\"#Video_solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">20</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-21\"><a href=\"#Easy_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">21</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Easy Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-22\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Thinking_Feet\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">22</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Thinking Feet</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-23\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(Intuitive!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">23</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (Intuitive!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-24\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">24</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Andy and Betsy both live in Mathville. Andy leaves Mathville on his bicycle at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/a/d4a153611677412b957f0e3eaa60f979132c9d3b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1{:}30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"34\" height=\"14\" />, traveling due north at a steady <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> miles per hour. Betsy leaves on her bicycle from the same point at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/2/722b1c8a811f2da6bfbd78149ea7e461a70fa79c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2{:}30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"34\" height=\"14\" />,  traveling due east at a steady <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/f/edf074831eb5bc9e61d6d6e09f525a86e3068f6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> miles per hour. At what time will they be exactly the same distance from their common starting point?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/7/5579aa1d3992a9e9c5a14bfafd14c063cba987f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) } 3{:}30 \\qquad \\textbf{(B) } 3{:}45 \\qquad \\textbf{(C) } 4{:}00 \\qquad \\textbf{(D) } 4{:}15 \\qquad \\textbf{(E) } 4{:}30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"471\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>== This page has some problems with rendering; thanks to everyone trying to fix it&#160;:)\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>At <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/2/722b1c8a811f2da6bfbd78149ea7e461a70fa79c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2{:}30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"34\" height=\"14\" />, Andy is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> miles ahead. For every hour that they both travel, Betsy gains <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> miles on Andy. Therefore, it will take her <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> more hours to be the same distance from the starting point as Andy, which occurs at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/7/8b7e8f4033b03214a231ba47a3d6952c98260f2f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(E) } 4{:}30}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"79\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/0/9e070d6f8e647897b62ef47fc978dc51078f725e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8h = 12(h-1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"120\" height=\"20\" />  \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/d/0dda9566439d7c18f4d912331cd75926a6236881.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\Rightarrow 8h = 12h - 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"138\" height=\"16\" />  \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/0/70034b5a4fcb46271604b9ed0dfdd40809ef484a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\Rightarrow 4h = 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"87\" height=\"14\" />  \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/5/5955faa240c69dabf727597d3a4612f39dfcdf2d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\Rightarrow h = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"69\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p>Since Andy started at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/a/d4a153611677412b957f0e3eaa60f979132c9d3b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1{:}30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"34\" height=\"14\" />, the catch-up time is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/6/f9686d63695dd69cbbac0e513395842977a5c438.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4{:}30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"34\" height=\"14\" />.  \nAnswer: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/e/75e41e3cd48cee2c6866cfbb4386a8e99d3482f5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(E)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"29\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>Alternatively, from Betsy's perspective:  \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/3/c/93ca439c06b26ef8c247e70b4eeed5a18f22f106.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8(h+1) = 12h$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"120\" height=\"20\" />  \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/a/25a3c4b9f7c1fe34af585b1e12f753180a3b5af0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\Rightarrow 8h + 8 = 12h$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"129\" height=\"16\" />  \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/b/36bc4028601774c5a74cbd3527344b8afc254a06.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\Rightarrow h = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"69\" height=\"14\" />  \nSame result: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/e/dde270a1246287df62b7b0d7fff16516c970e387.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(E) } 4{:}30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"68\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28Simplest_Version.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(Simplest_Version)\">Solution 2 (Simplest Version)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (Simplest Version)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Andy goes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> mph, Betsy goes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/f/edf074831eb5bc9e61d6d6e09f525a86e3068f6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> mph.  \n</p><p>We know that Betsy starts 1 hour after Andy, so she will be 8 miles behind.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/0/420dcc4f8ee12aa43d510ff77f09e16060530b8b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12x - 8 = 8x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"105\" height=\"15\" />  \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/2/48278feabc12b74336a9e312cd7d44deaa9f3313.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4x = 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"55\" height=\"14\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/3/fa3dad5c8598e3861d752c84a5092fae939eb473.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\,\\rightarrow\\,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"26\" height=\"9\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/f/2effc7979b1c93e59356b73253d75e2740b33105.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p>2 hours after Betsy's start time is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/0/ec043b4f8d15bc62ced7fe1a3a8b2a388ad54d20.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\text{4:30}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"43\" height=\"24\" />\n</p><p>-XaberTooth\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Try the answer choices:\n</p><p>At <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/1/a11653807c291faca2a444d434d641e90e3aa8c3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3{:}30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"34\" height=\"14\" />: Andy <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/9/6f9f1411e0a30ead616b66680cfb1cd0c7da2cf4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=16$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"36\" height=\"13\" />, Betsy <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/d/a9db8e5d5e287f2a6273684b945e552f4b2f908b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"39\" height=\"14\" />  \nAt <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/5/6c5d289baefe7fe13a5c02c4754052937802ef70.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3{:}45$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"34\" height=\"14\" />: Andy <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/7/3977e633206d445595eeaf919054f2cf6ed70716.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=18$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"36\" height=\"13\" />, Betsy <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/e/53ed5cd8320d9c0ed2b5d6b3c4034eb36ac46619.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"39\" height=\"14\" />  \nAt <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/0/3d01e758b040791aa9fef72ae1d5e2475aacd70c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4{:}00$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"31\" height=\"13\" />: Andy <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/c/0dcb49ff6ace1db0efbfe7c09b305bbafd4d581e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=20$\" width=\"36\" height=\"12\" />, Betsy <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/7/3977e633206d445595eeaf919054f2cf6ed70716.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=18$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"36\" height=\"13\" />  \nAt <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/6/e76bc66d2e4c2695805a7f16449503141ac66bb1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4{:}15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"34\" height=\"14\" />: Andy <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/5/2a563cc56764eec7a0f7b5016d2d0386ed20927c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=22$\" width=\"36\" height=\"12\" />, Betsy <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/3/0e30f03fba9052d6355bbb09c3137bb51b5abe76.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=21$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"36\" height=\"12\" />  \nAt <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/6/f9686d63695dd69cbbac0e513395842977a5c438.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4{:}30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"34\" height=\"14\" />: Andy <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/4/83445362a265e9c56134f8ff4234dea28f90ec43.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=24$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"39\" height=\"14\" />, Betsy <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/4/83445362a265e9c56134f8ff4234dea28f90ec43.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=24$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"39\" height=\"14\" />\nYou can visualize this using a table:\n</p><p>\\begin{array}{c|c|c}\n\\textbf{Time} &amp; \\textbf{Andy - 8 mph} &amp; \\textbf{Betsy - 12 mph} \\\\ \\hline\n3{:}30 &amp; 16 &amp; 12 \\\\\n3{:}45 &amp; 18 &amp; 15 \\\\\n4{:}00 &amp; 20 &amp; 18 \\\\\n4{:}15 &amp; 22 &amp; 21 \\\\\n4{:}30 &amp; 24 &amp; 24\n\\end{array}\n</p><p>Thus the correct answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/7/8b7e8f4033b03214a231ba47a3d6952c98260f2f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(E) } 4{:}30}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"79\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~vgarg\n</p><p>~SunSine\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4\">Solution 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/4/2d400d0b2895ab757eee90008834822f8fb3023e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{lcm}(8,12)=24$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"120\" height=\"20\" />, the time for Andy to reach 24 miles is  \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/9/149ec94b4cee238618f625eb32329a7b900fbf15.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$24/8 = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"72\" height=\"20\" /> hours.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/b/8bb13b6475727a5c9ee665a7248331f864e30b18.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1{:}30 + 3{:}00 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(E) } 4{:}30}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"190\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>Note: Alternatively we can find that the time for Betsy to reach <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/9/e290f2cba0ba0e11c0b91630da15a408da2fcf1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$24$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> miles is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/d/0cd7828dcc161ce370d988b71fb8576ff09c04ea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{24}{12} = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"57\" height=\"38\" /> hours. So we have\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/6/45684546d62c94ee87399ac433457fccd29d9e34.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2{:}30 + 2{:}00 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(E) } 4{:}30}.\\]\" width=\"191\" height=\"28\" />\n</p><p>~Boywithnuke  \n</p><p>~minor edits by ChickensEatGrass  \n</p><p>~minor edits by RISHADA\n</p><p>~Note by JerryZYang\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_5\">Solution 5</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 5\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Andy goes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/1/24117e291677dad02207afb1d4d9dd3879e75eeb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"21\" height=\"14\" /> miles, Betsy goes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/a/30a1c27febde0860f9ffc3721253e3e35d396308.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12(x-1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"76\" height=\"20\" /> miles.  \nSet equal:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/e/61e775343dc72ae09441a1f1f4be734cab6b6d31.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8x = 12(x-1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"120\" height=\"20\" />  \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/a/e3a7d2fc90ba884dd53b8f19e40efc34d2b7b06e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\Rightarrow x = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"69\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p>Thus the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/7/8b7e8f4033b03214a231ba47a3d6952c98260f2f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(E) } 4{:}30}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"79\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~minor LaTeX edits by zoyashaikh  \n</p><p>~minor <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/latex.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\LaTeX$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"46\" height=\"15\" /> edits by i_am_not_suk_at_math\n</p><p>~minor LaTeX edits by Pipii\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_6\">Solution 6</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 6\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Using constant rates:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/a/66a3b8b18f4d164e7e4c1570a999a0954b88f83c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\begin{array}{c|c|c} \\textbf{Time} &amp; \\textbf{Andy} - 8\\text{ mph} &amp; \\textbf{Betsy} - 12\\text{ mph} \\\\ \\hline \\hline 1{:}30 - \\text{Starting} &amp; 0 \\text{ miles} &amp; 0 \\text{ miles} \\\\ \\hline 2{:}30 &amp; 8 \\text{ miles} &amp; 0 \\text{ miles} \\\\ \\hline 3{:}30 &amp; 16 \\text{ miles} &amp; 12 \\text{ miles} \\\\ \\hline  4{:}30 &amp; 24 \\text{ miles} &amp; 24 \\text{ miles} \\end{array}\\]\" width=\"404\" height=\"105\" />\n</p><p>Thus the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/7/8b7e8f4033b03214a231ba47a3d6952c98260f2f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(E) } 4{:}30}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"79\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~i_am_not_suk_at_math  \n</p><p>~minor LaTeX edits by vinceS\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_7_.28Calculus_Overkill.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_7_(Calculus_Overkill)\">Solution 7 (Calculus Overkill)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 7 (Calculus Overkill)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let  \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/c/abc85af54b2be45eaa13a27e025991a6248908e5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D_A(t) = 8t$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"88\" height=\"20\" />,  \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/a/24a284b45f65c7efae7b0a339905ac12a0da5568.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D_B(t) = 12(t-1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"143\" height=\"20\" /> for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/2/b92a92c4993647198c92de827314f42820aa9a88.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t \\ge 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p><p>Difference:  \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/c/6fcc483f95ab522f428e2fed3f43023be63c8c24.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F(t) = 12(t-1) - 8t = 4t - 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"249\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p>Set <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/c/6acf8b4fea5ae736a3fe76b2ea0f766bfd5eca77.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F(t)=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"70\" height=\"20\" />:  \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/2/7b202131f2af7361296b9a7571ae00f2118b03f6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4t - 12 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"91\" height=\"15\" />  \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/9/5a95da72d5cf7fc737cc94b0473a4675cafe2bd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"42\" height=\"14\" /> hours.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/4/c743ec8504199abbd8febd2905e6e56e3ea1ff9f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1{:}30 + 3 = 4{:}30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"122\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p>-apex304\n</p><p>==Solution 8 (Easy to understand, fast)(Detailed)== NOT EASY AT ALL\nLet \\( t \\) denote time in hours measured from 1:30 PM:\n</p><p>\\( t&#160;:= \\text{hours after } 1:30 \\text{ PM} \\).\n</p><p>Thus \\( t = 0 \\) at 1:30 PM, \\( t = 1 \\) at 2:30 PM, and the physically relevant domain for both riders having left is \\( t \\geq 1 \\).\n</p><p>Velocity/position (vectorized).\nChoose orthonormal basis \\( \\{ i, j \\} \\) with \\( i \\) east and \\( j \\) north. Define piecewise position vectors \\( r_A(t), r_B(t) \\in \\mathbb{R}^2 \\) (for all \\( t \\geq 0 \\)):\n</p><p>\\( r_A(t) = 8t \\, j = (0, 8t) \\),\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/8/2a82ec7be273277e75d5a37bd364742d7b256b31.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[r_B(t) = \\begin{cases} (0, 0), &amp; 0 \\leq t &lt; 1, \\\\ 12(t - 1) \\, i, &amp; t \\geq 1, \\end{cases} = (12 \\max\\{t - 1, 0\\}, 0).\\]\" width=\"447\" height=\"53\" />\n</p><p>Define scalar distance functions (Euclidean norm / 2-norm):\n</p><p>\\( D_A(t)&#160;:= \\| r_A(t) \\|_2 = \\sqrt{0^2 + (8t)^2} = 8t \\),\n\\( D_B(t)&#160;:= \\| r_B(t) \\|_2 = 12 \\max\\{t - 1, 0\\} \\).\n</p><p>We seek \\( t \\) with \\( D_A(t) = D_B(t) \\) and \\( t \\geq 1 \\). For \\( t \\geq 1 \\) the equality reduces to the linear equation\n</p><p>\\( 8t = 12(t - 1) \\).\n</p><p>Bring like terms together:\n</p><p>\\( 8t = 12t - 12 \\implies 12 = 12t - 8t \\).\n</p><p>Compute the difference \\( 12t - 8t \\) digit-by-digit: \\( 12t - 8t = (12 - 8)t = 4t \\). So\n</p><p>\\( 12 = 4t \\).\n</p><p>Divide \\( 12 \\) by \\( 4 \\) carefully: \\( 12 \\div 4 = 3 \\). Hence\n</p><p>\\( t = 3 \\).\n</p><p>~N0lan\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_by_FormulaFocus_.28Logical.2C_Good_Editing.2C_.7E1:00.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_FormulaFocus_(Logical,_Good_Editing,_~1:00)\">Video Solution by FormulaFocus (Logical, Good Editing, ~1:00)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by FormulaFocus (Logical, Good Editing, ~1:00)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/shorts/AMcBj_LsyQw\">https://www.youtube.com/shorts/AMcBj_LsyQw</a>\n</p><p>~Ebai\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_baoziba\">Video Solution by baoziba</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by baoziba\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IVABusYQujw\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IVABusYQujw</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Daily_Dose_of_Math\">Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=11\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<pre><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/LN5ofIcs1kY\">https://youtu.be/LN5ofIcs1kY</a> \n</pre>\n<p>~Thesmartgreekmathdude\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_DDM\">Video Solution by DDM</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=12\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by DDM\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/s6ZFcqpIWj4\">https://youtu.be/s6ZFcqpIWj4</a>\n</p><p>~piggydude\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28Fast_and_Easy.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(Fast_and_Easy)\">Video Solution (Fast and Easy)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=13\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (Fast and Easy)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/fjpeOuUMOyc?si=ROuzlwgz7UByUx_9\">https://youtu.be/fjpeOuUMOyc?si=ROuzlwgz7UByUx_9</a> \n</p><p>~ Pi Academy \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Power_Solve\">Video Solution by Power Solve</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=14\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Power Solve\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QBn439idcPo\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QBn439idcPo</a> \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Chinese_Video_Solution\">Chinese Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=15\" title=\"Edit section: Chinese Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1852uBoE8K/\">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1852uBoE8K/</a> \n</p><p>~metrixgo\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution.28Quick_and_Simple.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution(Quick_and_Simple)\">Video Solution(Quick and Simple)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=16\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution(Quick and Simple)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IVABusYQujw\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IVABusYQujw</a>\n~Sigma_Bob\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28Intuitive.2C_Quick_Explanation.21.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(Intuitive,_Quick_Explanation!)\">Video Solution (Intuitive, Quick Explanation!)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=17\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (Intuitive, Quick Explanation!)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<pre><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/c-UDo53KwFU\">https://youtu.be/c-UDo53KwFU</a>\n</pre>\n<pre>~ Education, the Study of Everything \n</pre>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_SpreadTheMathLove\">Video Solution by SpreadTheMathLove</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=18\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by SpreadTheMathLove\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dAeyV60Hu5c\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dAeyV60Hu5c</a> \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=19\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/gWSZeCKrOfU\">https://youtu.be/gWSZeCKrOfU</a> \n</p><p>~MK \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_